From 20e45d86febd34bacc2d9419d6f1fb3c9771b7db Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: terminills <tdeters@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 16:37:04 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 27/43] cef: complete observer teardown before renderer
 deletion

AI_PHASE: cef-osr-browser

AI_STATUS: shutdown-order-fix-under-validation

ROOT_CAUSE: RunSingleProcessCleanupOnUIThread called RenderProcessHostImpl::Cleanup while run_renderer_in_process remained true; Cleanup returned before notifying RenderProcessHostDestroyed, leaving AgentSchedulingGroupHost bound when the host was directly deleted.

FIX_REASON: Clear the in-process renderer flag before Cleanup so normal observer teardown runs before host deletion.

SCOPE: libcef/renderer/alloy/alloy_content_renderer_client.cc

VALIDATION: prior hosted OSR replay painted and closed, then isolated the AgentSchedulingGroupHost state DCHECK to CEFShutdown; capped coherent archive rebuild and hosted shutdown replay remain pending.

RISK: Changes ordering only in CEF's single-process cleanup path; multiprocess behavior is untouched.

AI_DECISION_CHAIN:; painted-and-closed PASS; shutdown DCHECK; Cleanup early-return source audit

Evidence:-cef-osr-geometric-runtime-20260725;-cef-shutdown-order-fix-20260725

Job:
---
 libcef/renderer/alloy/alloy_content_renderer_client.cc | 10 ++++++----
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/libcef/renderer/alloy/alloy_content_renderer_client.cc b/libcef/renderer/alloy/alloy_content_renderer_client.cc
index e7855e33..5853d66d 100644
--- a/libcef/renderer/alloy/alloy_content_renderer_client.cc
+++ b/libcef/renderer/alloy/alloy_content_renderer_client.cc
@@ -573,16 +573,18 @@ void AlloyContentRendererClient::RunSingleProcessCleanupOnUIThread() {
       content::RenderProcessHost::AllHostsIterator());
   if (!iterator.IsAtEnd()) {
     host = iterator.GetCurrentValue();
+
+    // RenderProcessHostImpl::Cleanup() deliberately returns without observer
+    // teardown while the in-process renderer flag is set. Clear the flag
+    // first so Cleanup() reaches RenderProcessHostDestroyed notifications
+    // before the host and its AgentSchedulingGroupHost are deleted.
+    content::RenderProcessHost::SetRunRendererInProcess(false);
     host->Cleanup();
     iterator.Advance();
     DCHECK(iterator.IsAtEnd());
   }
   DCHECK(host);
 
-  // Clear the run_renderer_in_process() flag to avoid a DCHECK in the
-  // RenderProcessHost destructor.
-  content::RenderProcessHost::SetRunRendererInProcess(false);
-
   // Deletion of the RenderProcessHost object will stop the render thread and
   // result in a call to WillDestroyCurrentMessageLoop.
   // Cleanup() will cause deletion to be posted as a task on the UI thread but
